  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "The technical signals we watch every week",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"h-6\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-6\">The technical signals we <span class=\"accent\">watch every week</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Small technical problems add up. We catch them before they cost you rankings.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"metrics\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"metric\"><span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-search\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"metric__name\">Crawlability</h3><p>Can Google reach every page that matters, and skip the ones that don’t?</p></li><li class=\"metric\"><span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-layers\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"metric__name\">Indexing</h3><p>Which pages are in Google’s index, which are missing and why.</p></li><li class=\"metric\"><span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-zap\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"metric__name\">Core Web Vitals</h3><p>Loading, responsiveness and layout shift on real visits.</p></li><li class=\"metric\"><span class=\"icon-tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-code\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"metric__name\">Structured data</h3><p>Schema that earns rich results and helps AI tools understand you.</p></li></ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "technical-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Everything in our technical SEO service",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-7\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"acc-split\">\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-7\">Everything in our <span class=\"accent\">technical SEO service</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Six areas we work on every month, in order of what will help you most.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"acc-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"acc\" open name=\"h-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary><span class=\"acc__num\">01</span><span class=\"acc__title\">Crawl budget and site architecture</span><span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"acc__text\">Clear URL structure, sensible internal links and rules for filters and parameters, so Google spends its time on your best pages.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"acc\" name=\"h-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary><span class=\"acc__num\">02</span><span class=\"acc__title\">Indexing and canonicals</span><span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"acc__text\">We fix duplicate pages, wrong canonicals, stray noindex tags and pages Google has crawled but not indexed.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"acc\" name=\"h-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary><span class=\"acc__num\">03</span><span class=\"acc__title\">Page speed and Core Web Vitals</span><span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"acc__text\">Images, scripts, fonts, caching and server response, fixed template by template.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"acc\" name=\"h-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary><span class=\"acc__num\">04</span><span class=\"acc__title\">JavaScript and rendering</span><span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"acc__text\">We check that content built with JavaScript is visible to Google and AI crawlers.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"acc\" name=\"h-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary><span class=\"acc__num\">05</span><span class=\"acc__title\">Structured data</span><span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"acc__text\">Organisation, service, product, article and FAQ schema, tested and kept valid.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"acc\" name=\"h-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary><span class=\"acc__num\">06</span><span class=\"acc__title\">Redirects, errors and launches</span><span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"acc__text\">Redirect chains, broken links and 404s, plus checks before every release.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"acc-split__visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">PageSpeed Insights · Mobile</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mk-rings\"><div class=\"mk-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e3f6ec\" stroke=\"#cdeedb\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a35b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"132.7 138.2\" transform=\"rotate(-90 28 28)\"/></svg><b>96</b><span>Performance</span></div><div class=\"mk-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e3f6ec\" stroke=\"#cdeedb\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a35b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138.2 138.2\" transform=\"rotate(-90 28 28)\"/></svg><b>100</b><span>SEO</span></div><div class=\"mk-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e3f6ec\" stroke=\"#cdeedb\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a35b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"129.9 138.2\" transform=\"rotate(-90 28 28)\"/></svg><b>94</b><span>Accessibility</span></div><div class=\"mk-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e3f6ec\" stroke=\"#cdeedb\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a35b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138.2 138.2\" transform=\"rotate(-90 28 28)\"/></svg><b>100</b><span>Best practices</span></div></div><p class=\"mock__heading\">Core Web Vitals · Mobile</p><ul class=\"mock-list\"><li><span>Largest Contentful Paint</span><span><span class=\"mock-flat\">4.1s →</span> <span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">1.8s</span></span></li><li><span>Interaction to Next Paint</span><span><span class=\"mock-flat\">380ms →</span> <span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">120ms</span></span></li><li><span>Cumulative Layout Shift</span><span><span class=\"mock-flat\">0.28 →</span> <span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">0.03</span></span></li></ul></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "technical-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "One-off fixes vs ongoing technical SEO",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white\" aria-labelledby=\"h-8\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-8\">One-off fixes vs <span class=\"accent\">ongoing technical SEO</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Why technical SEO services work better as a monthly service than a yearly audit.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"ba\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ba__col ba__col--before\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Once-a-year audit</span><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg> Problems found once a year, after rankings drop</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg> A long PDF that waits for a developer</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg> New releases break what was fixed</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-close\"/></svg> No one owns site speed</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"ba__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-arrow-right\"/></svg></span>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ba__col ba__col--after\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Ongoing technical SEO</span><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Weekly crawls catch problems within days</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Our developers fix issues as tickets, not reports</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Every release checked before it goes live</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Core Web Vitals tracked on every key template</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "technical-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Technical SEO audit or technical SEO service?",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-9\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-9\">Technical SEO audit or <span class=\"accent\">technical SEO service?</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Both have a place. Here’s how they compare.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"compare\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"compare__scroll\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"compare__table\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Feature</span></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"compare__us\">Technical SEO service</th><th scope=\"col\">Technical SEO audit</th><th scope=\"col\">In-house only</th></tr></thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Full technical check</th><td class=\"compare__us\"><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td>Depends on tools</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Prioritised fix list</th><td class=\"compare__us\"><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"compare__no\" aria-label=\"No\">–</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Fixes made for you</th><td class=\"compare__us\"><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td>Optional</td><td>If developers are free</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Weekly monitoring and alerts</th><td class=\"compare__us\"><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"compare__no\" aria-label=\"No\">–</span></td><td>Rarely</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Checks before every release</th><td class=\"compare__us\"><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"compare__no\" aria-label=\"No\">–</span></td><td>Sometimes</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Monthly report in plain language</th><td class=\"compare__us\"><span class=\"compare__yes\" aria-label=\"Yes\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span></td><td><span class=\"compare__no\" aria-label=\"No\">–</span></td><td><span class=\"compare__no\" aria-label=\"No\">–</span></td></tr></tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"compare__note\">Need a one-off review first? See our <a href=\"/audits/website-audit/technical-seo-audit/\">technical SEO audit</a>.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "technical-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Your first three months",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white process\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"timeline-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"process-title\">Your first <span class=\"accent\">three months</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">We fix the biggest problems first, then move to steady monitoring.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"timeline\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Week 1–2</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Full crawl and baseline</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We crawl the site, review Search Console and set up weekly monitoring.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Week 3–6</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Priority fixes</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Indexing, canonical and redirect problems, fixed by our developers or handed to yours as clear tickets.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Month 2–3</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Speed and structure</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Core Web Vitals work on key templates, internal links and structured data.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"timeline__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"timeline__when\">Every month</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"timeline__title\">Monitor and report</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Weekly alerts, release checks and a monthly report on what changed.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "technical-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
