  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Technical SEO questions, answered",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-10\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-10\">Technical SEO questions, <span class=\"accent\">answered</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a topic. Can’t find your answer? Ask us on a free 30-minute call.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs tabs--pills faq-tabs\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"FAQ topics\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-11-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"tabs-11-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\">The service</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-11-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"tabs-11-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\">Results</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__pill\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-11-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"tabs-11-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\">Working together</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panels\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--plain\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-11-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-11-tab-0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>What are technical SEO services? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Work on the parts of your website that affect how search engines crawl, render, index and rank it: structure, speed, indexing, structured data, redirects and errors.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>How is this different from a technical SEO audit? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">An audit is a one-off review with a list of fixes. The service is ongoing: we monitor every week, fix issues and check releases before they go live.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>Do you make the fixes yourselves? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Yes, if you’d like us to. Our developers work in WordPress, Laravel, Shopify and most modern stacks. We can also hand clear tickets to your team.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--plain\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-11-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-11-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>How soon will we see results? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Fixing indexing and crawl problems can show results within weeks. Speed and structure work usually shows over two to three months.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>How do you report? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">A monthly report with crawl health, indexing, Core Web Vitals and the fixes we made, in plain language.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--plain\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-11-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-11-tab-2\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>Can you work with our developers? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">Yes. We write tickets with the problem, the fix and how to test it, and review the changes before release.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details class=\"faq-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>Is there a minimum contract? <span class=\"faq-item__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-item__answer\">No long lock-in. Plans run monthly after the first three months.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"faq-tabs__more\"><a class=\"button button--outline\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact us</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "technical-seo",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
